<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 442 0 R
/T (1.1.1 Emergency Response Delays)
/E (1.1.1 Emergency Response Delays)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
636 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 442 0 R
/T (Reporting emergencies, crimes, accidents, medical crises, disasters often involves multiple phone calls, unclear locations, and delayed coordination. Critical minutes are lost when citizens cannot quickly and accurately communicate emergency details to relevant authorities. Rural communities, in particular, lack access to integrated emergency response systems.)
/E (Reporting emergencies, crimes, accidents, medical crises, disasters often involves multiple phone calls, unclear locations, and delayed coordination. Critical minutes are lost when citizens cannot quickly and accurately communicate emergency details to relevant authorities. Rural communities, in particular, lack access to integrated emergency response systems.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
637 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
